  "rules": {
    "CONSTRUCTION": {"title":"Construction","content":"A Drone constructs a new building by becoming it; it is consumed and its worker supply is released. A Hatchery creates Larva and supplies creep. Most other Zerg structures require creep; Hatchery and Extractor are exceptions. Lair/Hive and Greater Spire are morphs of existing buildings, not new Drone-built structures. A Hive satisfies Lair/Hatchery tech; Greater Spire retains Spire tech."},
    "PRODUCTION": {"title":"Production","content":"Larva production is shared by workers, army, and Overlords. A tech building normally unlocks Larva products rather than producing those units itself. Unit morphs consume the source and pay an incremental cost; they do not consume another Larva. Additional supply is required when the final form uses more supply than the source."}
  }
